## Backend Implementation Checklist

- [ ] Read this file before coding
- [ ] Data model: create/update persistence models and migrations when data changes are required
- [ ] Data access: create/update data-access code, using bound parameters only
- [ ] Business logic: implement the rules in the business-logic layer, not in entry points
- [ ] Entry point: expose endpoints through thin handlers that validate input and delegate
- [ ] Tests: follow the Testing Strategy section
- [ ] Complete the framework-specific checklist steps in this file, if any
- [ ] Run the project build or type-check command and the backend test command
- [ ] Verify no sensitive data exposure in logs/errors
